[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_aqhxa")
fish_name = "CEO Shark"
grade = 3
sprite = ExtResource("2_7hjkq")
catch_blurb = "It smells like...victory?"
description = "Everyone knows that fish have a particular stench to them. The CEO Shark knows only the stench of victory.
A young CEO Shark constantly pines for the spotlight, spending most of its time swimming in sunlit zones. Despite its tendency to swim above them, most denizens of the deep look down on the CEO Shark...at first.

An inevitable part of every CEO Shark’s life cycle is realizing that there just isn’t enough daylight to make them shine. The only reasonable conclusion to this species is to abstain from sunlit zones and become an agent of the night. Early morning rises, late curfews, and shameless afternoon naps—they claim it improves their productivity, and scientists are scrambling to learn why.

Shortly after a CEO Shark adopts this hustle, it achieves tremendous success. No more coral-walled cubicles, and no more cheap barnacle brew. Wealth and fame become familiar to them, but when they stare into the reflection of their ice bubble plunge in the morning, they can’t quite recognize themselves.

If a CEO Shark is lucky enough, it will meet someone of luscious hair and unmatched charisma and fall in love. When this happens, the CEO Shark learns to love its past self. 
"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cr3nmjdvpgh0a"
